00:10:46.783 --> 00:10:49.733
Not a whole lot, but something.

00:10:49.733 --> 00:10:51.792
As another side question,
if you were to pay,

00:10:51.792 --> 00:10:54.122
and put zero dollars in the comments

00:10:54.122 --> 00:10:55.525
on Facebook and YouTube.

00:10:55.525 --> 00:10:57.731
If you were to pay, what would you pay

00:10:57.731 --> 00:11:00.574
for a month subscription
of the #AskGaryVee Show?

00:11:00.574 --> 00:11:01.551
It would be really good data.

00:11:01.551 --> 00:11:02.951
And it would be really important for me,

00:11:02.951 --> 00:11:04.310
and I'm not going to
do it, so don't worry.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.708
I just want to know the truth.

00:11:05.708 --> 00:11:06.821
So don't try to make me feel good,

00:11:06.821 --> 00:11:08.548
and don't try to razz me.

00:11:08.548 --> 00:11:09.737
Just tell me the truth.

00:11:09.737 --> 00:11:11.015
Like hey, this is it.

00:11:11.015 --> 00:11:12.704
The next 150, the rest of my life

00:11:12.704 --> 00:11:14.264
I'm going to a subscription per month.

00:11:14.264 --> 00:11:17.179
Here's a, you know, minimum of five, 20.

00:11:17.179 --> 00:11:18.495
Minimum of what do you think?

00:11:18.495 --> 00:11:21.206
Guaranteed 11 episodes per month?

00:11:21.206 --> 00:11:23.625
12 if you like that we're at least

00:11:23.625 --> 00:11:24.931
minimally bringing on that.

00:11:24.931 --> 00:11:26.009
As many as 20.

00:11:26.009 --> 00:11:27.570
What would you pay?

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:28.880
That would be interesting too.

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:30.111
I think it's good learnings for all of us.

00:11:30.111 --> 00:11:31.341
So keep it real.

00:11:32.951 --> 00:11:34.927
- [Voiceover] Dan asks
"Would 22 year old Gary Vee

00:11:34.927 --> 00:11:36.856
"have watched the #AskGaryVee show?"

00:11:36.856 --> 00:11:39.164
- Would 22 year old Gary Vee

00:11:39.164 --> 00:11:41.537
#AskGaryVee Show?

00:11:41.537 --> 00:11:42.644
Good question.

00:11:42.644 --> 00:11:44.245
The answer is no.

00:11:46.315 --> 00:11:49.170
Which is interesting, but true.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:51.267
22 year old Gary knew he had it

00:11:51.267 --> 00:11:53.977
and didn't want to
learn from other things.

00:11:53.977 --> 00:11:56.567
Which I don't know if it's
a strength or a weakness,

00:11:56.567 --> 00:12:01.136
but he believed in what he had in his body

00:12:01.136 --> 00:12:03.062
and I believed in what I was going to be

00:12:03.062 --> 00:12:05.656
and felt that my fresh naive eyes

00:12:05.656 --> 00:12:07.137
and my intuition was more valuable

00:12:07.137 --> 00:12:08.949
than putting things in my head

00:12:08.949 --> 00:12:10.797
which would then be known as

00:12:10.797 --> 00:12:13.466
well look at how that person
did it and they did it well.

00:12:13.466 --> 00:12:15.970
I truly do believe that one of the reasons

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:17.812
that so many of you watch this show

00:12:17.812 --> 00:12:19.322
is because I say things different,

00:12:19.322 --> 00:12:20.812
I come from different angles,

00:12:20.812 --> 00:12:22.242
and I really do believe that's because

00:12:22.242 --> 00:12:24.138
I don't consume anybody else's stuff.

00:12:24.138 --> 00:12:25.044
I think it helps me keep fresh.

00:12:25.044 --> 00:12:28.568
I think my stuff comes from operating.

00:12:28.568 --> 00:12:30.629
I think you know, just,
I'm giving you a wide view

00:12:30.629 --> 00:12:31.983
because the background changed.

00:12:31.983 --> 00:12:34.284
I think my stuff comes
from actually operating.

00:12:34.284 --> 00:12:36.633
I think my stuff comes
from an intuitive place.

00:12:36.633 --> 00:12:41.274
And I don't, I don't
try to consume anything.

00:12:41.274 --> 00:12:42.992
As a matter of fact I was at this event

00:12:42.992 --> 00:12:44.563
where there was an opening
key note during the dinner

00:12:44.563 --> 00:12:46.324
where I had to like meet with a client.

00:12:46.324 --> 00:12:47.967
Boy I really didn't like it.

00:12:47.967 --> 00:12:49.237
It was a really bad experience.

00:12:49.237 --> 00:12:50.262
One I wanted to like go up,

00:12:50.262 --> 00:12:51.662
I literally wanted to go up on stage

00:12:51.662 --> 00:12:54.178
and hit him with a chair
WWF style and take over.

00:12:54.178 --> 00:12:55.203
Like all right!

00:12:55.203 --> 00:12:57.793
And you know like, I just don't

00:12:57.793 --> 00:12:59.354
feel like that's my learning style.

00:12:59.354 --> 00:13:01.363
So 22 year old Gary would

00:13:01.363 --> 00:13:05.340
spit in the face of 
the #AskGaryVee Show.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.863
Sorry DRock.

00:13:06.863 --> 00:13:08.791
And that's that.

00:13:08.791 --> 00:13:10.472
Missed you guys a lot.

00:13:10.472 --> 00:13:13.033
Really pumped to be back in the saddle.

00:13:13.033 --> 00:13:15.411
We'll try to bring it
stronger and harder tomorrow.

00:13:15.411 --> 00:13:17.293
You keep asking questions.

00:13:17.293 --> 00:13:19.968
I'll keep answering them.

